{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:18:199","content":{"id":199,"title":"第十九课：相机与透镜","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e3dbd968-aa29-420f-ac6f-ee978e10e21e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图形学成像方法："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"98c84f0b-b7a0-46a8-8282-5a6c83e672b2","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a879dcb7-450d-4cd6-bc60-cca4a8a623e0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5ea830ee-1039-4b7d-962f-698d3746702c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光栅化"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e001e3c0-6cbd-4018-86ee-efaa876a970c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"87d310d2-8a58-40af-96e5-2cb9afe9d52e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光线追踪"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a1b59328-bcef-46d6-8d13-be3569d2a7b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"都是合成方法成像，还可以通过捕捉方法成像，比如相机拍照成照片。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"649b1124-0b43-4c59-a505-196e1711673a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光传播是有时间的，限制光在极其微小的时间内能看到的东西，可以看到光传播的过程，计算摄影学。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cc571f2d-f4ee-4bb6-8f75-687027b6f940","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相机背后到底是什么？相机的截面图，镜头，棱镜，机身，感光元件。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_90616fa2-a793-4120-b4e2-c4a8d18bdb70.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"90aeba29-823a-4e69-a60e-ddcde739e4f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"39be4112-5bc9-445a-8063-41c6b9cb36ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最早的时候，从小孔成像开始，有对应相机的，针孔相机，最常见的是带棱镜的相机"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a2fd7b43-4635-42b0-b5ec-b20c91189576.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"33da4b37-c6e8-4148-bd07-466f7c60cf93","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"46cc31c7-be46-42cc-8c5d-3c106380e8ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"去掉了镜头的相机，控制光进去的部件，快门（Shutter），在多少分之一秒内光进入相机"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0593eba1-3473-4bcf-adcd-985600a814a6.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"2b2ba1be-4713-46c2-be71-3b84805273a4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b9d5ab9d-01cf-4ef9-ade4-41e10ebd3b72","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光进入相机后被捕捉到，什么东西捕捉光线并记下来，传感器，记录的是什么，记录是 irradiance"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4f7355a7-aaee-48ca-9211-f0e2b468fcfc.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"08ddae66-c325-41f4-918d-1b61b2aa003e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"19e5a40b-c025-4414-b58a-ed3e5183aeb7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果相机没有棱镜、没有针孔，还能拍上照吗？这是不可能的，每个像素收集的都是 irradiance，无法区分方向。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b0e9eec6-402b-4e76-ac61-5a061210e382","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目前在研究一些传感器分开记录不同方向的光，未来有可能。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d508fbbc-ec9f-4265-bca1-17cc9ac94020.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"1491eaf3-d9d3-40b1-a6ed-052c59863371","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2fef09bb-3eeb-4c1d-89e0-f04200b7a888","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"针孔相机，公元前就发现小孔成像的原理"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c5783a85-baa2-4a3b-8b91-9a45a3b73ad0.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"8e405be8-f02d-4b6d-97c8-d57ba24c08c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"731628f3-b701-4d4d-9dc4-2c390e299a6f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"直到今天都可以利用针孔拍照，针孔相机拍出来的东西是没有深度可言的，没有虚化的东西，看到的都是锐利的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"510b3812-e202-4aed-aacb-66662e315db8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"做光线追踪的时候用的就是针孔相机的模型。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e655dfb4-2da9-43fa-9501-d645eccd6d1f.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c696a3b8-ee45-491c-b634-7a0c9e87605c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d90b3250-116f-4632-8e1e-659a596772cf.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"97954380-5ed9-4b12-a7b6-217bb12edb50","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"07f603de-22a9-47d3-ae07-28a7ed5867c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"视场 FOV，可以看到多大的范围，广角 -> FOV 大，什么因素决定视场，焦距和传感器大小"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1b39376c-a38d-414f-afa9-ebc290dd9752.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"53e2edc5-f248-44d1-a189-2aa7aa6bce49","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7159ef4a-0c3b-4a47-8fbc-5b8d486cae0e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不同的视场决定不同的拍照结果，通过焦距和传感器大小这样定义视场不太好定义，以 35mm 的胶片为基准，通过定义焦距的方式定义视场。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"477c621a-e991-4870-883d-827219f980cb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在手机上可能会说焦距有 28mm，手机厚度不到 1cm，怎么焦距有 28mm，因为手机的传感器大小不是 35mm，这是换算过去等效的焦距。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c090dbcc-97a1-47e2-8bcb-e77624afdae4.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"3f4a6a2c-c11e-4c5e-be37-95039f94b51a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5d30099f-500f-4343-94a1-8a7db25edb71","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不同角度的镜头，同一地方拍的，不同的视场"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2f3db66c-54d2-4ca9-8c2f-3edec2c74159.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4cc602b0-84fe-4d8f-9912-da6d0ae5e721","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6c033fb3-47d9-44fb-8c64-47cc0a30bc80","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果能改变传感器的大小，小的传感器对应小的视场"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0174549c-c710-4fab-97c0-9aa77379c48e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在混淆使用了两个概念，传感器的胶片，这两个不一定一样，平常认为是一回事，认为传感器接收到的图像就是最终成像的图像，但是对于渲染器来说，传感器负责记录收到的 irradiance，最后胶片负责存成什么样的格式"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_11a8ad32-07df-44b7-9981-a13683ce3685.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"a0307e0e-33ff-4592-947c-dff56f732d93","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"609a8f57-ce81-4086-90c3-e98173e2203e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"传感器的的不同大小，所以相机价格不相同，好的相机都是大的相机"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_348aeba4-8c0b-4190-bfb2-48e17635491b.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4cd12e77-0437-42fa-97cb-aa38f934b37d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"31a6c3b5-74d8-4618-ab34-2b334e9307c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在小的传感器上怎么维持视场，把焦距变小"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6d29eabf-db8e-4be0-aa08-4d7900c0d4f3.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"81826656-7ed9-46af-8978-3d88cb7db323","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fc759099-c5f4-45e3-a6ee-943d3a9ea776","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"曝光是什么？H = T * E，time ✖️ irradiance，亮度由进来多少光，一个是进来多长时间，累计起来就可以得到曝光"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c3659f37-8402-48f5-a75c-d5306ecb79d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"曝光时间由快门决定。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9197f012-14ff-42d2-98e6-fb1fef677b79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"irradiance 由相机的什么因素决定："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"5bf10f45-88d5-4478-a3ea-558fab4187c9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"75b299fb-ebed-4154-b0f9-0cb9d61295ef","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ccc7c7f0-7c0f-4c92-94d9-91b17c2dc0b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光圈大小"}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a6d37d54-d486-4044-90c0-a3e8043922c3.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"551ee05d-533c-4763-8c24-b7d442bd0948","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5d7e7e54-1647-486d-b635-c1dc2822cb1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相机里面有哪些因素影响拍出来亮还是不亮呢？"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"287b4058-40ff-4ad4-919b-ef887694ec9c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"65ad4045-9aac-4ee9-962f-2df9c17131d0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1609957f-d036-43db-828f-15ef5bb2971a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"光圈大小，由 f-stop 控制，光圈是一个仿生学设计，仿照人的瞳孔，在比较暗的时候，瞳孔会放大，这样会接受到更多的光，可以看清楚更多东西，在亮的时候瞳孔会缩小，不让更多光进来灼烧视网膜"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c63a4dc1-254c-451b-ac0b-a8648e4cf6b2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f45c873a-684d-470e-8b29-d54d20a75de9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"快门速度，快门开放的时间，时间越短，更少的光进来"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1e827823-f17d-48ca-923b-dac051264f04","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4788d04d-14c8-45cb-aa83-30d8017d845f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"感光度，ISO 增益，最简单的理解，ISO 是一个后期处理，当感光元件已经感知到了光，觉得太暗，可以增大光度，这个乘可以发生在硬件上，调节灵敏度"}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_7cbe1a0a-d450-4800-a77b-c4941c85218b.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f2b9fdb6-920e-443d-be9f-9e3f1c9e9534","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a2402fd3-eeb4-41c2-b97c-c880982f4cc4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"说明了各种现象"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f9376